OL,3,GNEWSA'Lip reading is my superpower',
OL,4,Asays CiN choirgirl
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old schoolgirl has been
OL,7,Fchosen to join the BBC Children in Need
OL,8,FChoir, which will perform live to the
OL,9,Fnation as part of this year's annual
OL,10,Ffundraising event.
OL,12,FJosephine, from Luton, was born deaf,
OL,13,Fbut she was also born to sing.
OL,15,FShe has been supported by the Phoenix
OL,16,FGroup for Deaf Children in Stevenage, a
OL,17,Fcharity that provides opportunities and
OL,18,Factivities across Hertfordshire and
OL,19,FBedfordshire ` and benefits from
OL,20,FChildren in Need funding.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
