OL,3,GNEWSA'Lip reading is my superpower',
OL,4,Asays CiN choirgirl
OL,5,
OL,6,FJosephine says the charity has really
OL,7,Fhelped her confidence, adding: "I used
OL,8,Fto feel shy and scared, but not anymore
OL,9,Fafter being with other people who are
OL,10,Fdeaf like me."
